  "question": {
    "text": "A closed pipe of length <math><mn>22</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>c</mn><mn>m</mn></math>, when excited by a <math><mn>1875</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>H</mn><mn>z</mn></math> source forms standing waves. The number of pressure nodes formed in the pipe are [velocity of sound in air <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>330</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>m</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mn>s</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>]"
